  "translation": "Today at noon, I went from home with my friend to eat at a restaurant. My friend asked: 'What do you want to eat? Dumplings or buns?' I said: 'I want to eat dumplings and buns, I'll eat both.' We entered this restaurant. There were many people inside. We waited ten minutes. The waiter first served the dumplings. The dumplings were very delicious. My friend asked: 'How many can you eat?' I said: 'I will eat ten.' Then we also ate buns. But there were too many buns, we didn't finish. We spent fifteen yuan in total."
